# Ansible Inventory & Playbook Execution on `stapp03`

Configured an INI-format [Ansible](https://docs.ansible.com/) inventory in `/home/thor/playbook/inventory` on the jump host (`thor@jump-host`) targeting Application Server 3 (`stapp03`) in Stratos DC, and verified playbook execution with `ansible-playbook -i inventory playbook.yml`.

## Task Requirements & Implementation

* **INI Inventory Path (`/home/thor/playbook/inventory`):** Created on `jump-host` inside `/home/thor/playbook/`.
* **Target Host & Connection Variables:** Added `stapp03` with SSH connection and privilege escalation credentials (`ansible_host=stapp03`, `ansible_user=banner`, `ansible_ssh_pass=BigGr33n`, `ansible_become_pass=BigGr33n`).
* **Hostname Alignment:** Matched the inventory host alias (`stapp03`) to the Stratos DC server name.
* **Host Key Handling:** Added `/home/thor/playbook/ansible.cfg` with `host_key_checking = False` so non-interactive validation runs without SSH prompt blocks.

## Configuration Files

### `/home/thor/playbook/inventory`

```ini
stapp03 ansible_host=stapp03 ansible_user=banner ansible_ssh_pass=BigGr33n ansible_become_pass=BigGr33n
```

### `/home/thor/playbook/ansible.cfg`

```ini
[defaults]
host_key_checking = False
```

