## Troubleshooting Notes

| Issue | Cause | Resolution |
|---|---|---|
| `sudo` / privilege escalation failure | Missing become password in inventory | Included `ansible_become_pass=BigGr33n` on `stapp03` |
| Interactive SSH key prompt risk | Strict host key checking enabled by default | Configured `host_key_checking = False` in `/home/thor/playbook/ansible.cfg` |
| Unintended state drift on re-run | Non-idempotent tasks | Verified second run reports `
